ab" href="/jam/one-button-jam-2026/feed" data-label="tab_view_jam_feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget after_voting is_over" id="jam_submitter_9126201"><p>This jam is now over. It ran from <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-07 08:00:00</span> to <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-14 06:00:00</span>. <a href="/jam/one-button-jam-2026/results">View results</a></p></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h1 class="text-center"></h1>
<h1 class="text-center">ONE BUTTON JAM</h1>
<p class="text-center"><strong>One Button. Infinite Creativity.</strong></p>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-center">👋 Welcome!</h2>
<p class="text-center">
Welcome to <strong>One Button Jam</strong>!
Can you create an entire game using only <strong>one button</strong>?
</p>
<p class="text-center">
One action. Endless possibilities.
Make a platformer, puzzle, horror game, rhythm game, comedy, experiment &mdash;
anything you want. The only requirement is that the gameplay is built around a
<strong>single input</strong>.
</p>
<hr>
<h2>💡 What counts as “one button”?</h2>
<p><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Space</li>
  <li>Left Mouse Button</li>
  <li>Screen Tap</li>
  <li>Gamepad A</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-right">📜 Rules</h2>
<p class="text-right">The game must be created during the jam.✅</p>
<p class="text-right">Gameplay should use <strong>only one button/input</strong>.✅</p>
<p class="text-right">Menus are not part of the challenge.✅</p>
<p class="text-right">Any engine is allowed.✅</p>
<p class="text-right">Solo developers and teams are welcome.✅</p>
<p class="text-right">Any art style is allowed.✅</p>
<p class="text-right">
The same button can do different things depending on the situation:
jump, attack, dash, interact, change gravity, restart time, or anything else.
✅</p>
<p class="text-right">
As long as the player only has <strong>one gameplay input</strong>,
you are following the theme.✅</p>
<p><br></p>
<hr>
<h1 class="text-center"><strong><br>💬 Join our Discord community!</strong><strong><br></strong></h1>
<h3 class="text-center"><strong> Meet other developers, find teammates, get announcements, ask questions, and share your progress during the jam.</strong><strong></strong></h3>
<p><strong><strong></strong><strong><br></strong></strong><br></p>
<h2 class="text-center"><strong><a href="https://discord.gg/JmFaqqUp8" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">https://discord.gg/JmFaqqUp8</a></strong><strong></strong></h2>
<p><strong><strong></strong></strong><br></p>
<hr>
<h2>⭐ Rating Categories</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Creativity</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Theme</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Visuals</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Audio</strong></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-center"></h2>
<h2 class="text-center">❤️ Beginners Welcome</h2>
<p class="text-center">
Never joined a game jam before? This is a great place to start.
Simple controls mean more time for creativity.
</p>
<p class="text-center">
Everyone is welcome.</p>
<p><br></p>
<h2 class="text-center">🚀 Good luck!</h2>
<p class="text-center">
Think outside the box.
One button can do more than you think.<br></p></div></div><script type="text/template" id="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_tpl"><div role="dialog" class="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_widget lightbox_widget base_widget  force_login has_fields lightbox" id="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_9339986" tabIndex="-1"><button class="close_button"><svg role="img" class="svgicon icon_cross2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round" version="1.1"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button><h2>Log in to continue</h2><p>This jam is using <a href="http://itch.io" target="_blank">itch.io</a> to host entries. You&#039;ll need to register or log in on
      itch.io in order to <span class="on_submit">submit your game</span><span class="on_join">join this jam</span>.</p><p class="on_submit">After signing in you can create a new game on itch.io then
      return here and click the <em>submit game</em> button again to enter your game.</p><p><a data-register_action="jam_submit" class="button" href="/login?intent=jam_submit&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fone-button-jam-2026">Log in</a><span class="or_split"> or </span><a data-register_action="jam_submit" class="button" href="/register?intent=jam_submit&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fone-button-jam-2026">Register</a></p></div></script></div></div><script type="text/template" id="loading_lightbox_tpl"><div aria-live="polite" class="lightbox loading_lightbox"><div class="loader_outer"><div class="loader_label">Loading</div><div class="loader_bar"><div class="loader_bar_slider"></div></div></div></div></script><script type="text/javascript">new I.ViewJam('#view_jam_2687943', {"voting_end_date":"2026-07-16 20:00:00","id":417981,"start_date":"2026-07-07 08:00:00","end_date":"2026-07-14 06:00:00"});init_JamLayoutHeader('#jam_layout_header_8784194', {"autocomplete_props":{"i18n":{"search":"Search","search_placeholder":"Search for games, jams, tags or creators"},"ca_source":25,"ca_types":{"game":1,"browse_facet":8,"featured_tag":7,"jam":4,"bundle":6},"autocomplete_url":"\/autocomplete","search_url":"\/search"}});
